WEBVTT

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:32.630
All right, Alex.

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:34.400
Just keep your eyes on this coin.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.180
You are getting very sleepy.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.320
You are getting very sleepy.

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:42.300
You are getting very sleepy.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:44.950
You are getting very sleepy.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:47.620
You are getting very sleepy.

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:51.380
That worked well!

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:54.590
Next time, I'll have to hypnotize Squiddie!

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:57.020
I love you!

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:58.720
Oh, my!

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:03.330
Hang on, Squiddie!

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:09.230
<b>Squidn't That Hypnosis?!</b>

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:10.690
Lemon

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:12.050
Hello.

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:13.160
Is Squiddie here?

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:16.280
She's cleaning up the bottles in the back.

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:18.090
Excuse me!

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:18.610
Maybe I should practice

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:19.390
Yes?

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.030
on someone else before I use it on Squiddie.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:23.160
Eiko, look at this!

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:24.230
What's that?

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:25.570
Is that one of those things for hypnosis?

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:28.310
You are getting very sleepy,

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.760
and you are now a crow.

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.210
As if that would even work that easily.

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:36.240
You are getting very sleepy,

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.240
I don't know what she's thinking, but I'd feel bad

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:38.340
telling her it's not working at all.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:39.290
and you are now a crow.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:41.140
I guess I'll just pretend it's working.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.590
There! It's done!

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:46.940
It worked!

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:50.590
Then again, maybe Eiko's just easily hypnotized...

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:50.190
A ramen and a beer, please.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.660
Right away.

00:02:50.590 --> 00:02:53.100
I've got to try it on someone else.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:53.980
Nagisa!

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:57.570
You are getting very sleepy.

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:01.110
You are getting very sleepy.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.960
You are getting very sleepy.

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:08.060
You are getting very sleepy...

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:11.100
and you are now a monkey.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:11.920
A monkey?

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.000
Not quite...

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:18.710
She's horrible!

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:20.900
I should try it on Chizuru, too.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:21.810
Chizuru!

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.680
Please look at this coin.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:29.320
You are getting very sleepy.

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:28.640
I wonder what she'll tell me to be?

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:32.430
And you are now a cute kitten!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.700
It worked!

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:41.490
If it worked on Chizuru, 
this will definitely work.

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:45.490
That's the last of it.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.620
Good job, Squid Girlie.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.250
Look, I found a squiddle money!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.580
That's so lucky.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.080
What's wrong with everybody?

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.670
They're acting crazier than clownfishes!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:00.990
Squiddie!

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:02.620
Watch this coin!

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:04.010
What's up with you?

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.760
You are getting very sleepy.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:09.390
You are getting very sleepy.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.140
You are getting very sleepy.

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.600
You are getting very sleepy.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.020
Yes! It's work-

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.960
This is boring. 
Will you just squit it?

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:19.630
Why isn't it working?

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:22.410
It worked with everyone else!

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.030
Sorry about that, Sanae.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.650
I didn't want to hurt your feelings, 
so I pretended it worked.

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:27.840
Me, too.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:28.990
Sorry!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:34.420
But... I thought I had it down perfect.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.210
Hypnotism isn't something an amateur 
can just learn right away.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:45.160
Master it! Hypnotism that anyone can do!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.060
Let's hypnotize the person you have in mind.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:45.180
First, hang a coin from a string.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:50.030
Can I try to hypnotize someone, too?

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.680
I just said that hypnotism isn't...

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:56.520
Nagisa, I want you to look at this coin.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:04:59.450
What's this?

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:01.320
I want to run away, but I can't.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:04.260
You are getting very sleepy.

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:06.920
You are getting very sleepy...

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:09.750
And you are now a monkey!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.430
Squidcess!

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:19.030
What the hell did you do?

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:21.450
I just copied what Sanae did and it worked!

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.260
Can I try on you, too?

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.560
You are getting very sleepy.

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:29.000
You are getting very sleepy...

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:28.630
What's this?

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:29.520
My body's...

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:32.510
And you are now a crow!

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:39.610
This is a squidtacular trick!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:43.480
With this, I could easily 
complete my squidvasion!

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:50.740
You don't have to hypnotize me, 
you can do whatever you like to me!

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:51.890
You are get-

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:54.500
Squid Girlie!

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.990
Get off of me!

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:57.740
Get off... Huh?

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:03.640
That was too squidding close.

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:05.130
However,

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.960
it looks like the day is mine.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:10.180
Once I put you in a hypnotic trance,

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:13.050
this place will be mine
 to squid with as I please!

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:15.300
Squid Girlie, you shouldn't.

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:17.060
I'm sorry, Takeru.

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:19.280
But I am an invader.

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:21.610
I must be ruthless, for all squidkind.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.320
Squid Girlie...

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:27.640
You are getting very sleepy.

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:30.110
You are getting very sleepy.

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.830
And you are now a cat!

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:38.900
Wait, it's not working?!

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:40.290
Why?

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.040
It's broken!

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.430
What's up with that coin, anyway?

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:47.510
It's not a normal coin!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:50.260
There it is.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:51.550
The three stooges!

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:55.140
That's the "coin for use against aliens that will

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:58.560
always successfully hypnotize" that we developed.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:03.370
But it looks like it also works on 
regular humans, so it's a failure.

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:05.690
I'm not an alien!

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:10.030
Huh? What am I doing up here?

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:12.700
The hypnosis has worn off!

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.950
Another rubbish invention from you three...

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.910
Please forgive us, 
we'll never do it again!

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.970
So, Squid Girl.

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:25.750
What were you planning to 
do once you hypnotized me?

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:28.060
Well, just...

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:33.430
You know, I'd love to try 
hypnotizing you, too.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.260
Can I?

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:38.850
Excuse me...

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.350
I'll be right squiddy there!

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.860
I'd like a break.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:49.320
Strange, but it feels like 
the hypnosis isn't working.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.280
It's n-nothing...

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.730
I'm taking these out right now!

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:57.900
Now we can take a break.

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:00.620
We don't have to worry about her invading.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.920
I wish I could tell her what to do...

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:08.380
I'm so squidding sick of hypnosis!!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.650
Yay!

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:33.650
<b>Shall We Join Tentacles?!</b>

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:35.490
Please have a seat and...

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.070
I'm here to issue a challenge.

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:41.370
Not another headpiece.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:43.990
What the squid is that?!

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:48.630
What sort of joke is it to leave out 
my characteristic 10 tentacles?

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.960
I don't think that's the 
real problem here.

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:54.360
So what, you're going to make 
Ayumi put that on again?

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.790
That won't be necessary.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:57.990
This is already a Squid Girl.

00:08:58.520 --> 00:09:02.020
Eww, that's so creepy! 
Why did you make it do that?

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.000
That's not all she can do.

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:07.590
She can also cook, wait 
tables and greet guests.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:09.190
Welcome.

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:12.340
And when she's done for the day, 
the tentacles retract inside,

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:13.690
so she doesn't take up much space.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.610
What do you think, Squid Girl?

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:18.320
Can you keep up with that?

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.100
I can retract my tentacles too...

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:24.290
Who cares about that?!

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:27.700
I have to say, that's already 
well past "doll" stage.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.820
Did you make that all by yourself?

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:32.800
Nope, I got a little help from them.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:33.760
Them?

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.550
The three stooges?!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:39.190
As fellow inventors, our souls resonated.

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:42.330
It seemed like fun, so we became his friend.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:45.560
This is the worst team ever.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.330
The power is amazing!

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:56.200
We've got it in the bag, with her!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.240
Idiots!

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:01.610
How is this supposed to be 
like the real Squid Girl?

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:04.660
The real Squid Girl doesn't have missiles 
shooting out of her mouth!

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:09.530
I see, you mean we should 
fight her on her own turf!

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:11.400
You're perfectly right!

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:14.000
We've got to destroy the 
other side's pride!

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.760
Defeat Squid Girl!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.420
Oh yes!

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:21.410
So we joined forces and perfected 
what you see before you.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:24.600
What do you think about 
our dream collaboration?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:27.010
These guys are dangerous!

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:28.060
They are?

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:33.020
I tried competing with you before, 
but I could not win.

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:35.670
So I want to try again,

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:39.780
and when I win, my Squid Girl 
will be the real Squid Girl!

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.060
I see...

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.470
The terms are the same as before.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:45.430
We're going to see who can tear 
off the other's hat first.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:48.980
Or you can give up and relinquish 
the title of the real Squid Girl.

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:50.760
Why can't we just refuse?!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:52.290
Wait a sec.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:53.830
If we let him win,

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:56.880
maybe we can avoid having these 
stupid competitions in the future.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.480
That means you should lose, Squid Girl!

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:00.660
No way!

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:04.600
If my name was stolen by that thing,
 I might as well be squidding dead!

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:08.480
That's what bugs you the most?

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:17.760
Is everyone ready?

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.860
Ready... go!

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:21.640
Victory to the first tentacle!

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:26.690
It's fast!

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:29.120
Our tentacle counter is perfect!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.830
There's more where that came from!

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:45.610
Take this as well!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.240
Squid Girl!

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:58.830
It's strong...

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.400
But that thing is so creepy.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.860
You're pretty good.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.410
Is that all you've squiddy got?

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.120
It's squiddy pathetic.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:10.640
She's being ridiculed by a doll?!

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:14.710
We're exploiting the original's 
psychological weakness.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.510
You've got a big mouth for a doll!

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:19.980
You just haven't seen my real squid powers yet!

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:22.750
All spark and no sting.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.180
The stereotypical small-fry character.

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:28.140
You talk about invading all the world, 
but have you squiddy done that?

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:32.350
Why don't you just quit 
and go back to the sea?

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.560
We're back to grade school.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.230
Don't under-esquidmate me!

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.990
We thought of that, too!

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:48.160
Ours is superior in every way!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:50.200
There's no way we'll lose!

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:58.170
Nagisa, please take these out.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:59.330
Sure!

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.880
Where are Eiko and the squid person?

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.220
What's this cord?

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:10.310
What's this?

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.550
Oh no!

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:13.320
Her output is falling!

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.930
Hurry and switch to the 
alternate power source!

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:16.770
Roger!

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.820
A bicycle generator.

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.210
That's not high tech at all!

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:34.080
I'm bushed...

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.500
Already?

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:37.880
Squid Girl, here's your chance!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.280
I can't... anymore...

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:41.340
Not you, too?!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:42.610
Here's our chance!

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:51.390
You can't run from her!

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:56.140
Now the title of "The Real Squid Girl" is ours!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:13:59.720
Oh, no!

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:00.840
The cord...

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:01.730
...is too short!

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.280
Time to counterattack!

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.290
I'm taking that hat!

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:07.860
Not so fast!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.250
What?!

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:12.580
She just blew up!

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:14.540
Her head's gone!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.220
She got away!

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:20.500
You've always got to have 
an ace up your sleeve.

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:33.980
The winner is Squid Girl!!

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:38.560
Looks like I lost again.

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:40.800
But I won't lose next time.

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:42.910
We'll be back!

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:46.280
I guess I'll let you off easy today.

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:51.230
Don't ever squidding come back!

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:54.140
Cans    Bottles

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:57.530
What are you doing?

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.430
I dropped it because you scared me!

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:03.130
You were going to put it in 
that one from the very start.

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.350
Yes.

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:07.560
I realized something.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:11.590
There's something I'm seriously 
lacking as an invader.

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:14.910
And that is... an evil heart!

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:17.560
That's why you threw 
the bottle into the cans?

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:22.560
<b>I Ink We're Alone Now?!</b>

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.390
That's right!

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:26.220
That hardly counts as an evil act!

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:30.210
An invader shouldn't be kind or squidsiderate.

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:33.410
So you're back to the usual 
winging-it campaign.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.870
Squiddie!

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.830
Let's cuddle!

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:42.060
How many times do I have to tell you

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:46.130
not to lay your tentacles on me, you stalker?!

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:49.280
Wow, I feel like I was being 
really nasty back there.

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:51.510
Hurt me more, Squiddie!

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.550
That had the opposite effect!

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:55.770
Curry's done.

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:56.960
Right.

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.020
Now it's perfect.

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:06.120
No, it's not!

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.230
What are you doing?

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:08.230
Give me that back!

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:10.780
You can't give this to a customer!

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:14.240
Actually, that's pretty good...

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.900
That is really good.

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:24.000
It makes me sad that I came up 
with this delicious topping.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.670
Eat or be sad, pick one and stick with it.

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:28.760
That will be 750 yen.

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:31.180
Sorry, this is the smallest bill I have.

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:37.560
Then first I'll give you back 9000 yen.

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:39.930
And here's the rest of the change.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.020
I mixed 2000 yen bills in there.

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.940
2000 yen bills, huh...

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.230
I guess it's my lucky day.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.400
Chizuru looked at me.

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:54.530
The 2000 yen notes are 
having an effect already!

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:56.640
Thanks, Squid!

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:00.410
That happens now and then.

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:04.650
Next time, I'm going to squidding  
give him all his change in coins!

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:07.260
You're going to piss Chizuru 
off if you keep this up.

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:09.890
Do you think I can be an invader 
if I'm scared of Chizuru?

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.010
Squid Girl.

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:13.030
Do you have a moment?

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:13.880
Crap!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.510
She's mad at me.

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.780
Could you run an errand for me?

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:18.510
Huh?

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:21.140
I need salt and pepper.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.270
This is strange.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:27.270
She saw what I did, 
so why didn't she get mad?

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:32.190
Shrimp flavored potato chips!

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:36.680
No, I've got to get salt and pepper.

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:40.660
But someone truly evil would 
use this money to buy...

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:43.960
That'll be 386 yen for the 
two bags of shrimp chips.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:46.620
There's no going back after this.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:49.130
Oh, that can't be helped I guess.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:51.500
You're not angry?

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:55.120
No, accidentally buying shrimp 
chips instead of salt and pepper

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:56.220
happens all the time.

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:59.050
What's going on?

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:02.280
Why isn't Chizuru getting mad?

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:07.980
As an invader, I can't let something 
like this slow me down!

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:10.510
Hey, want to take a little break?

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.070
Sure!

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:15.900
I brought you a squiddle 
shaved ice for a snack.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:16.950
Wow, really?

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:19.950
This is some kind of plot again...

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.830
Thanks, Squid Girlie.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:24.750
Then here you go!

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:27.240
I guess I don't know my own

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:29.330
strength and the ice went flying 
right out of the cups!

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:31.910
Squid Girlie... behind you...

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:35.990
What's this?

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:36.920
That was...

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:40.360
Feels nice and cold.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:43.220
Thank you, Squid Girl.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:46.480
This is more tenterrifying than if she got mad!

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:48.880
We're going shopping now.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.000
Okay.

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:53.820
Hey, where's Eiko and Takeru?

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.860
It's just going to be me and you today.

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:58.780
I'm going to be alone with Chizuru!

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:03.500
If you see something you want, 
just put it in the basket.

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:08.140
Chizuru wouldn't say that. 
This is some kind of trap!

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:10.080
First things first...

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:12.480
Want to get some shrimp chips?

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:14.740
I'm fine without them today!

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:16.990
That's unusual.

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:18.930
Are you feeling sick?

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:20.050
I'm fine!

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:23.550
Then want to go eat after we're 
done with the grocery shopping?

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.460
Yes, this is definitely weird.

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:30.520
Wait, is this going to be my last supper?!

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:33.810
You sure you only want shrimp casserole?

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:36.480
You could've gotten the shrimp curry too.

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.800
<b>Ends this week!</b>

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.800
<b>Loaded with Shrimp!

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.800
<b>Summer Special Menu</b>

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:38.760
It's over soon...

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.200
She just said it'll be over soon...

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:45.190
Are you cold, Squid Girl?

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:47.080
You sure?

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.080
I'm going to run away before she kills me!

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:51.760
The toilet's that way...

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:53.350
Here it is.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:55.460
The shrimp casserole.

00:19:57.260 --> 00:19:59.510
This is the last time I have shrimp.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.730
If she's going to kill me anyway,

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:05.730
I might as well enjoy this
 last meal to the squidest.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:09.120
Then I'll start...

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:11.310
So... Squid Girl...

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:13.850
There's something I wanted to ask you.

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:15.910
Here it comes!

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:19.860
Are you... scared of me?

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:24.490
I'm so sorry!

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.330
I'll never do anything bad again!

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:29.640
What are you talking about?

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:30.990
Huh?

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:37.610
I was just thinking that you and I are almost

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.250
never alone together.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:42.130
Really?

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:48.260
I was feeling a little 
jealous of Eiko and Takeru.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.500
I mean,

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:54.370
you're always playing with Takeru outside.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:57.730
And you're always playing 
video games with Eiko.

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:03.420
So I thought maybe if I made the 
effort to be alone with you,

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:06.000
we could become good friends, too.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:11.290
If that's what it is, then let's talk!

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:12.750
Really?

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.330
I'm glad!

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:17.910
What do you like to do most in the world?

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:20.820
Hmm... well, I think I'm happiest

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:21.640
when I'm working in the restaurant.

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:25.090
Wow, she's not scary at all.

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:28.680
Now the oceans between us aren't so big.

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:31.640
We're back!

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:34.820
Oh. Squid Girl was with you...

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:37.730
Yeah, we talked about all sorts of stuff.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:41.760
I had the wrong squidpression 
of Chizuru all this time.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.650
Oh, come on!

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:46.240
I saw that she is moved by the 
same things humans are moved by...

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:48.420
she has the same dreams humans have...

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:50.830
you could say she even has a human side!

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:54.140
I am... human.

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:59.420
See, we can joke about things like this now!

00:22:00.530 --> 00:22:04.720
I think we should spend a little 
more time talking together, Squid Girl.

00:22:06.360 --> 00:22:08.620
Oh? About what?

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:41.980
It's Squid Girl!

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:42.940
Next up are:

00:23:42.940 --> 00:23:44.320
Practice makes squid perfect?!

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:45.650
Ink that a festival?!

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:48.220
No really, ink that a festival?!

00:23:48.220 --> 00:23:52.820
You better watch them, or else 
something tenterrible will happen!
